first 300: Quay Pages\n\nA. Sample\n\nThe Seawall\n\nAt low tide the harbour wall stood dry above the slipway.\n\nNets hang over the rail to dry before the tide turns.\n\nThe last boat is in by dusk.\n\nThe Lamp Room\n\nA single lamp burns above the door all night.
